<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/37/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/name> "The Malaysian Examinations Council Act 1980, which"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/37/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/37/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "in this Act is referred to as the \"principal Act\", is amended in section 2 by inserting after the definition of \"Council\" the following definition: ' \"Fund\" means the Fund established by section 17;'."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/37/eng@> .
